Description: A server-agnostic R client for SeaTable
    (<https://seatable.io>) databases. Provides a connection object capturing a
    server URL, API token environment variable and workspace, together with
    functions to query, read, write and cache tables. Contains no default
    server and no domain-specific logic; intended as a shared foundation for
    packages such as 'fafbseg' and 'bancr' that wrap it with their own
    server configuration.
